    "long_instructions": "## Fix the Bugs\r\n\r\nSame program. Now fix it.\r\n\r\n1. Find the row that failed. Its Branch column tells you which branch of the code to check.\r\n2. Tell the AI Tutor the input, what you expected, and what you got. Ask what might cause it.\r\n3. Fix that branch yourself, then rerun the row. It should pass now.\r\n4. Press Enter with nothing typed. The program crashes. Add a check so a blank gets a message instead.",
